Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:13.69,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真っ赤な線を描いたちっぽけな心の話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.01,0:00:20.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僕らの未来はどこに向かって光るの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.58,0:00:27.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,続きの線を描いた　色づいてしまう度にまぶしい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:32.46,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,そんな心のリズムを繋ぎだす
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:39.97,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,かなしいかなしいかなしいかなしい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.80,0:00:46.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,うれしいうれしいうれしいうれしい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.38,0:00:53.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,２つの感情に揺さぶられては
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.07,0:01:01.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,まだ見ぬ指先を照らし出してくだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.32,0:01:08.20,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,このまま嘘でもいいから夢泳がせて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.20,0:01:13.90,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,かなしいかなしい今を探してく
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.09,0:01:21.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僕らは見えない未来を信じてる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.52,0:01:27.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,だから悲しい悲しい今を探しては光った
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.39,0:01:28.54,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,引つかた
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.33,0:01:34.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說 這樣的話不太安定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.63,0:01:36.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感覺馬上就要倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.13,0:01:37.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,確實是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.31,0:01:39.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在這裡再加一根棒子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.47,0:01:40.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.05,0:01:42.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總覺得小根幹勁十足啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.76,0:01:45.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和姍姍來遲的你不一樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.01,0:01:47.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我去買東西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.29,0:01:49.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.06,0:01:52.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島同學
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.02,0:01:54.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.32,0:01:56.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的傷沒事了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.31,0:01:58.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 我沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.90,0:02:00.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉讓你擔心了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.82,0:02:03.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈也和我聯絡了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.11,0:02:05.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然還沒有好好地道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:07.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也不知道會怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.66,0:02:11.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果是莉莉和根島同學的話一定沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.70,0:02:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,買東西 一路小心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.00,0:02:15.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,停 羅密歐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.42,0:02:27.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在這裡要悲傷地說出台詞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.49,0:02:29.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為遇見了你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.24,0:02:31.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,才讓我的人生變得紛亂了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.95,0:02:34.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果沒有你我也活不下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.41,0:02:38.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而你 卻不能屬於我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.12,0:02:45.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而我已無法想像沒有你的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.75,0:02:47.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不錯 真不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.75,0:02:49.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是 是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.02,0:02:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.30,0:02:53.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,別偷懶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.76,0:02:55.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我 我才沒偷懶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.89,0:02:57.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島 你知道仁阪在哪嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.56,0:03:10.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪 排練開始了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.93,0:03:00.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這邊用這種顏色可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.85,0:03:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把錘子給我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.39,0:03:04.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說 你要好好扶穩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.06,0:03:07.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 顏料還沒干呢別亂碰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.70,0:03:16.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,加藤同學在找你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.58,0:03:20.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找到了 你快過來看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.66,0:03:23.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,佐伯的設計真的太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.41,0:03:24.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好可愛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.91,0:03:25.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,挺好的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.67,0:03:27.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪穿那個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.13,0:03:28.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定很台適
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.29,0:03:29.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.25,0:03:31.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不愧是要考服裝設計學校的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.67,0:03:33.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話說這個真的能做出來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.13,0:03:36.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要量好尺寸就沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.14,0:03:40.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,果然還是考慮一下布料的選擇吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.97,0:03:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那當然了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.94,0:03:46.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.24,0:03:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.19,0:03:53.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你就這麼走了是不是不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.78,0:03:56.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不幹了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.12,0:03:59.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我再也不想和這件事扯上關係了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.74,0:04:00.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.78,0:04:03.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,至今為止都一起排練了吧 這不是白費了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.08,0:04:04.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那些服裝也是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.83,0:04:07.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有誰會願意成為別人的笑柄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.12,0:04:09.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那種衣服...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我明白你的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.30,0:04:14.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是 那個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.01,0:04:16.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就為了大家忍受一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.13,0:04:18.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,「大家」是誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.85,0:04:23.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比如說我 有班上的同學們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.22,0:04:26.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家都相信著仁阪你所以才會拜託你的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.48,0:04:30.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你又明白我的什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:32.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我明白的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.15,0:04:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在大家面前穿女裝都會害羞的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.28,0:04:37.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 仁...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你真是太缺心眼了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.78,0:04:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知道你是老好人還是同情心氾濫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.41,0:04:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:47.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.12,0:04:49.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.67,0:04:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 仁阪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.38,0:04:57.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.01,0:04:58.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,悠介
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.18,0:05:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼 吵架了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.89,0:05:04.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.23,0:05:13.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下 悠介
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.98,0:05:16.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.29,0:05:29.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 你叫什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.75,0:05:31.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫根島
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.67,0:05:32.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要吃鮭魚子嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.84,0:05:36.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝您
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,悠介 給 漢堡壽司卷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.47,0:05:41.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不是很喜歡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.89,0:05:43.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,並沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.22,0:05:45.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了 還有草莓聖代
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:47.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,聖代當然要留到最後啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.07,0:05:50.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一開始就吃對聖代也太失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.54,0:05:53.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,悠介
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:56.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,打朋友是不對的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.74,0:05:59.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只是用了點力甩開他的手而已
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:02.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就叫做打朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.91,0:06:05.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 也是我先用力抓他的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.66,0:06:08.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.73,0:06:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過 不是說被帥哥打的話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.79,0:06:13.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自己也會變成帥哥嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.58,0:06:15.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那不是賺到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.17,0:06:18.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我覺得你再來幾下也沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.81,0:06:29.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總之 因為悠介你朋友很少
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.40,0:06:31.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還是要好好珍惜他比較好哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:39.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他小學的時候不是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.53,0:06:40.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.28,0:06:44.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在足球部倍受歡迎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.53,0:06:46.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也有不少的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.70,0:06:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每年的生日會都很熱鬧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.04,0:06:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這種事情無所謂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.67,0:07:02.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 仁阪現在也很受歡迎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.30,0:07:04.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這次的文化祭還會有演出...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.01,0:07:04.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小根
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.05,0:07:07.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.89,0:07:08.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.31,0:07:12.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為你完全不和我說學校裡的事 我都不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.22,0:07:14.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:15.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上廁所
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:19.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島同學
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.61,0:07:24.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為他性格很怪癖 又很挑剔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.57,0:07:26.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想他一定是出於自己的考慮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.86,0:07:29.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,才選擇這樣游離於人群之外吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.20,0:07:32.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是他卻讓你打開了他的心扉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.13,0:07:34.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,讓你和他做朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.91,0:07:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大概也算是一件很厲害的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.63,0:07:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今後悠介也要拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.17,0:07:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.93,0:07:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,悠介
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.55,0:07:48.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,聖代上來了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.60,0:07:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,聖代要最後吃的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.02,0:07:54.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.69,0:07:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你爸爸是個好人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.10,0:07:58.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:04.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪 你真的不再扮演茱麗葉了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.61,0:08:07.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我討厭被人關注
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.45,0:08:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也不想要別人對我產生興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.03,0:08:11.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也一樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.99,0:08:15.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想看仁阪飾演的茱麗葉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.00,0:08:18.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,並不是覺得有趣之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.21,0:08:20.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為覺得這只有仁阪才能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:23.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算讓竹田來演也一樣會逗人發笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.38,0:08:24.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算男女主都讓女生來演也沒關係吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.80,0:08:26.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想看仁阪演的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.59,0:08:28.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,班上的人肯定也這麼想
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.18,0:08:29.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我才不管呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.97,0:08:31.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,羅密歐和茱麗葉什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.51,0:08:34.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也不過就是不去考慮雙方的立場和周圍的意見
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.64,0:08:37.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,任性地相愛然後又任性地殉情的古典劇情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.44,0:08:40.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我討厭這樣的劇情
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.90,0:08:43.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,果然沒用嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:45.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過被仁阪你這麼一說才發現
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.61,0:08:47.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,羅密歐與茱麗葉的故事真是殘忍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.03,0:08:50.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是實話實說而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.99,0:08:55.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是任性地相愛然後又任性地殉情嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.75,0:08:59.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,羅密歐和茱麗葉為什麼會做出這種事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.17,0:09:02.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為是悲劇所以才是這樣的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.21,0:09:05.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還是說有什麼即使捨棄生命
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.80,0:09:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也想要守護的東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.01,0:09:11.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大概就是「自己的想法」吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.60,0:09:18.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不覺得我們很像羅密歐與茱麗葉嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.01,0:09:21.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪能明白的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.81,0:09:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明明有了喜歡的人 卻還是被定下了對象
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.11,0:09:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家都否定自己的戀情 阻止自己
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.20,0:09:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是對本人來說
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.99,0:09:34.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只有那份心情才是唯一的真實吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:37.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這麼一想的話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.76,0:09:40.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就覺得我們與政府之間的關係很像是羅密歐與茱麗葉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.54,0:09:45.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且 他們的故事流芳百世 家喻戶曉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.27,0:09:48.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就證明即使是沒有廝守
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.63,0:09:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也沒有人認同
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.13,0:09:53.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這段戀情也並不是毫無意義
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.05,0:09:55.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就是想看這個
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.97,0:09:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果仁阪能繼續演下去的話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.47,0:10:00.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定會是世上最美的茱麗葉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.77,0:10:07.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還有 羅密歐與茱麗葉是四百年前發生的故事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.36,0:10:10.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那麼久遠的故事竟然流傳至今
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:12.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不覺得和古墳很像嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.95,0:10:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過古墳的歷史更加悠久
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.24,0:10:16.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然它們都被編入了教科書裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.95,0:10:20.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我們先學到的是古墳 果然印象還是會深刻一些吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.08,0:10:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,才不像呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.37,0:10:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,果然還是不行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.21,0:10:29.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然不像 但也不是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.59,0:10:31.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:35.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,既然你都說到這份上了 我會繼續演茱麗葉的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.85,0:10:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.22,0:10:39.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝你仁阪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:41.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為什麼你這麼高興啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.98,0:10:43.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是覺得很高興
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.19,0:10:44.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.02,0:10:51.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然 我還不是很瞭解仁阪的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.07,0:10:55.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但總覺得種程度上得到了你的認可吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.83,0:11:01.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我才沒有認同你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.33,0:11:04.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的錯覺嗎 怎麼這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.00,0:11:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.84,0:11:10.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剛才你笑了 笑了對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.25,0:11:11.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.05,0:11:12.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,絕對笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.13,0:11:14.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這才是錯覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.55,0:11:17.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看見了 稀有的東西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.60,0:11:18.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都說了...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.79,0:11:19.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明天會下雨嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.93,0:11:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都說我沒有笑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.60,0:11:31.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.34,0:11:34.76,Sub,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈:\N謝謝你的信!\N下個月的第四個週六是我們學校的文化祭\N你要來玩嗎?\N我們班要演羅密歐與茱麗葉,一定會很有意思的!\N我拿到入場券的話就給你寄過去\N天氣很熱,要注意身體\NP.S.其實我的暑假作業還一點沒做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.44,0:11:34.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈要是能看到這封信就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.45,0:11:38.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我就開始量了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.57,0:11:40.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下圍65
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.83,0:11:43.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說 真的有必要量這個尺寸嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.27,0:11:44.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有必要的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.42,0:11:46.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這樣的輪廓數據很重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.71,0:11:48.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,得好好測量才行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.80,0:11:52.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我要量胸圍了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:56.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說 你可不能把尺寸說出來哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.26,0:11:58.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我當然不會說的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.18,0:12:01.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,佐伯？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.35,0:12:05.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,騙人的吧 這麼大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.89,0:12:09.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話說 真的好軟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:10.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 不能碰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.77,0:12:12.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好狡猾 我也要摸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.70,0:12:17.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接下來輪到男生了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.35,0:12:19.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,首先從仁阪同學開始
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.24,0:12:21.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還挺瘦的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.37,0:12:25.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這樣應該就不用大幅修改紙模了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:26.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.71,0:12:31.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 我們可以看看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.13,0:12:33.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪同學腰好細啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.84,0:12:34.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,手指也好纖細啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:36.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 讓我摸一下 摸一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.76,0:12:38.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 不是給你們看的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.43,0:12:39.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真狡猾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.34,0:12:40.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只有你們嘗盡甜頭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.59,0:12:41.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,別妨礙我們
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.08,0:12:45.95,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有什麼啊 我們也想近距離看看摸摸仁阪同學啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.97,0:12:45.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,女生也真是兇猛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.27,0:12:49.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話說回來 果然是還是需要胸部吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.69,0:12:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也是啊 就用胸墊來做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.65,0:12:54.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要多大罩杯比較好呢 D怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.57,0:12:56.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 拜託你們
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.05,0:13:01.45,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你緊張什麼 還是喜歡更大一點的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.20,0:12:58.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然看起來很辛苦的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.87,0:13:01.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過看樣子應該能和大家和睦相處吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.55,0:13:02.91,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還是說你喜歡小一點的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.60,0:13:03.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.65,0:13:05.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大概
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.47,0:13:07.77,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是就這件衣服的外形來說也不能太小了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.77,0:13:10.69,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就無法滿足仁阪同學的要求了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.96,0:13:10.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就這樣繼續準備著
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.48,0:13:14.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,直到九月份開學
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.02,0:13:23.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然莉莉奈再次給我回信了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是在莉莉奈心中 我好像變成一個歷史愛好者了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.81,0:13:30.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然還是有些區別的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.10,0:13:36.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話劇的排練也進入正式階段
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:34.67,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 突然叫住你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.67,0:13:37.26,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我過去曾在橋上見過你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.61,0:13:39.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然你並不認識我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.49,0:13:40.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我認識你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.86,0:13:44.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是三天前寂寞地看著河面的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.13,0:13:45.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 卡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.16,0:13:47.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很好 雖然很好 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.34,0:13:48.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能不能在帶上一點
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.41,0:13:52.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家閨秀努力裝成小惡魔調戲良家男子的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.22,0:13:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不能
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:56.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我給你們帶慰問品來了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.85,0:13:58.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是甜甜圈啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:14:02.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還有 傳單也差不多從印刷廠發過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.37,0:14:03.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你們記得收以下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.02,0:14:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大部分的學生每天都留下來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.96,0:14:11.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,學校裡漸漸變得熱鬧起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.23,0:14:13.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這樣怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.35,0:14:15.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,尤其是高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.96,0:14:17.84,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然後下一場景再這樣過度
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.38,0:14:17.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.57,0:14:17.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,顯得活力十足
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.26,0:14:24.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,傳單做得挺好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.41,0:14:26.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要把這個送到實行委員那邊去對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.97,0:14:27.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我去送吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.26,0:14:47.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,給你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:49.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:51.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我來幫你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.23,0:14:54.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以嗎 排練呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.06,0:14:56.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想先休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:14:58.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,打擾了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.53,0:15:02.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,待會兒還要去排練嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.11,0:15:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,說叫我們五點去舞台那邊集合
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.70,0:15:08.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想應該是要繼續排練吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.34,0:15:09.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.45,0:15:14.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學 你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.00,0:15:17.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果說錯了的話 我先道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感覺你是在勉強自己去努力做好這件事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.97,0:15:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島同學好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.51,0:15:28.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是在勉強自己嗎 身體不舒服嗎 發燒了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.01,0:15:30.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是的 不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:35.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其實我的性格並不是很外向
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.73,0:15:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.86,0:15:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大概吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.73,0:15:39.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然我也不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:43.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算叫我演主角 我也沒想過要努力去做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.82,0:15:46.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也沒有「大家一起投入進去吧」這樣的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.24,0:15:49.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是覺得如果拒絕了的話 大家會不開心的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.41,0:15:53.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以或許就如根島同學所說 我在勉強自己
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.58,0:15:55.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.12,0:16:01.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是現在算勉強自己我也會把羅密歐演下去的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.47,0:16:06.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是的 茱麗葉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.47,0:16:11.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我很想見你 對你的思念宛如潮水
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.39,0:16:14.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回過神來我已經隨著月光來到此處
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.06,0:16:20.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果我也能這樣坦白自己的心意就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.48,0:16:24.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.03,0:16:26.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉會來參加我們的文化祭嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.74,0:16:28.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.91,0:16:30.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,入場券我已經寄給她了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.82,0:16:31.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,希望她能來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.08,0:16:36.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學的羅密歐很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.22,0:16:39.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學的演技即使在後勤組也廣受好評呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:41.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪也很努力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.42,0:16:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪同學努力得就像是變了一個人一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.72,0:16:49.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話說回來 劇組叫我們接吻呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.04,0:16:52.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 借過
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.59,0:16:53.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,讓開一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.26,0:16:55.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,借過
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.48,0:16:58.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好厲害啊 那是哪個班的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.36,0:17:03.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 你說接吻
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.07,0:17:03.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.98,0:17:06.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,說是想製造舞台劇的看點來著
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.21,0:17:11.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,當然 我們倆都拒絕了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.07,0:17:13.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.54,0:17:18.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說 你怎麼看仁阪 你覺得他怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.88,0:17:24.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,說實話 他令我感到意外
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.21,0:17:27.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我沒想到他能做到這一步
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.51,0:17:32.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看著他認真的身影 會覺得果然還是很帥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.72,0:17:34.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.29,0:17:36.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪很帥的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.69,0:17:39.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島同學呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.31,0:17:42.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你已經
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.48,0:17:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喜歡上莉莉了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.32,0:17:51.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我喜歡的人是高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.41,0:17:53.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈她...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.16,0:17:58.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說 高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.41,0:18:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喜歡又是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.10,0:18:06.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這算什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.47,0:18:10.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 我只是覺得說到底也不清楚喜歡是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.38,0:18:13.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.68,0:18:18.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個人總是會吸引自己的目光
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.35,0:18:20.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,會尋找身邊是否有他的影子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.27,0:18:24.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,會在早上因為期待在鞋櫃邊和他偶遇而心跳加速
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.19,0:18:26.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果沒能遇見的話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.07,0:18:28.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又會覺得有點失落
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.11,0:18:32.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而要是在走廊擦肩而過的話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.20,0:18:36.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僅僅如就能讓我開心一整天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.08,0:18:41.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下午的課數學也好體育也好都能努力去聽課
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僅僅如此就很幸福了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.04,0:18:47.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這就是我半年前的「喜歡」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.46,0:18:50.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那之後的「喜歡」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.23,0:18:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對我來說像是奇跡一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.55,0:18:58.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,六年級的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.43,0:19:01.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就想要是能和根島同學一起去旅行的話就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.64,0:19:04.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,修學旅行的時候 我們不在一個班
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.52,0:19:06.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以也沒有乘上同一個巴士
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.52,0:19:11.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,初二的時候 我就想和你接吻
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.69,0:19:15.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,班上的朋友們聊起了初吻的話題
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.12,0:19:18.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,除了根島同學以外我想不到別人了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.76,0:19:23.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,初三的時候 我想和根島同學上同一所高中
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.71,0:19:26.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想和根島同學在一個班裡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.54,0:19:30.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放學後一起留下來做委員之類的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.71,0:19:34.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這些願望全都實現了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.09,0:19:37.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很厲害吧 就像奇跡一樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.81,0:19:45.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想把這些一直當作寶物珍藏起來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.73,0:19:47.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,打算一生都不對那個人說出自己的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.56,0:19:49.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個人卻告訴我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.27,0:19:52.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他也用同樣的目光注視著我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.69,0:19:55.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我第一次和那個人接吻了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.03,0:19:59.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我那時幸福得就算下一刻死去也值得了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.70,0:20:02.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果這不是夢的話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.33,0:20:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我這一生再也不會有比這更好的夢了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.54,0:20:10.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以 我決定到此為止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:14.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.84,0:20:16.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.05,0:20:19.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒有被選中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.18,0:20:25.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為我不會嫁給根島同學你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.19,0:20:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是還是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.27,0:20:31.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根本沒法順利進行下去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.32,0:20:35.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我越來越喜歡你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.07,0:20:39.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我明明知道就算喜歡也沒有用
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.16,0:20:42.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼會 那種事...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.08,0:20:46.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能夠決定一個人一生唯一的愛人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.62,0:20:48.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一旦遇到這個人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.67,0:20:52.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你至今為止的戀情都會想謊言一樣消失無蹤
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.00,0:20:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或許他已經喜歡上了那個溫柔可愛又高貴的對象
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:04.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或許根島同學現在已經不喜歡我了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.02,0:21:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,即使這樣我也喜歡你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.23,0:21:10.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最喜歡你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.27,0:21:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,從五年前就一直喜歡著
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.82,0:21:16.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比半年前更喜歡 比昨天更喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.99,0:21:19.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,現在 最喜歡根島同學
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.21,0:21:30.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不可以 放開我 放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.67,0:21:38.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我啊 只要一觸摸到根島同學就會心跳加速
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.09,0:21:40.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,非常開心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.39,0:21:45.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 這份心情未來一定會讓我十分痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.64,0:21:47.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我明明很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.31,0:21:49.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,卻無法捨棄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.19,0:21:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島同學
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.82,0:21:57.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不明白啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.49,0:22:01.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,「喜歡」是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.41,0:22:26.19,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,さっきの言葉はまだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.19,0:22:28.72,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I can't say I want to say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.72,0:22:30.80,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,言えないままでしまってる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.80,0:22:33.08,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I always lie
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.08,0:22:35.37,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,星の瞬きほど早く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.37,0:22:37.80,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,願い事するひまも無く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.80,0:22:39.94,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,短い夏が終わってく
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.94,0:22:42.76,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I can't say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.76,0:22:45.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Heart beat sound
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.65,0:22:51.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,気づかないでいてね高鳴る鼓動
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.65,0:22:55.61,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Can't keep it to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.61,0:22:58.46,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自然にこぼれたはにかむ顔が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.46,0:23:04.79,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,隠せないメッセージ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.79,0:23:06.62,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I know why I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.62,0:23:09.08,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,未来を重ねた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.08,0:23:13.78,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,二人の温もりが ここに残ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.78,0:23:15.78,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,ありふれた日々に
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.78,0:23:18.38,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,はじまりのキスを
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.38,0:23:33.93,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,ひとりの夜は 君の夢を見てた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.96,0:23:37.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美咲的胸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.13,0:23:38.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.83,0:23:41.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下集 謊言一般的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.18,0:23:42.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話說回來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.85,0:23:44.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的好軟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:13.69,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}畫下等待的長線 這是心中小小的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.01,0:00:20.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}我們的未來 到底會走向何方呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.58,0:00:27.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}畫下連續的長線 接下來的旅途必定也耀眼奪目吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:32.46,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}就這樣 連接上心的旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:39.97,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷 悲傷 悲傷和悲傷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.80,0:00:46.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}快樂 快樂 快樂和快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.38,0:00:53.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}把兩份感傷的心疊放在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.07,0:01:01.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}看不清的未來裡誰才是該出場的配角
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.32,0:01:08.20,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}就這樣下去 即使是謊言也讓我把這美夢做完吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.20,0:01:13.90,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷地 悲傷地 現在就去尋找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.09,0:01:21.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}我們相信著看不見的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.52,0:01:27.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷地 悲傷地 去尋找著
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.39,0:01:28.54,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}現在就去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.41,0:22:26.19,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剛才想說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.72,0:22:30.80,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還沒能說出口
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.08,0:22:35.37,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,時間轉瞬即逝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.37,0:22:37.80,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,無暇許下心願
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.80,0:22:39.94,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,短暫夏日就此結束
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.65,0:22:51.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,別讓他發現 心聲難以克制
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.61,0:22:58.46,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自然流露的靦腆表情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.46,0:23:04.79,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,掩藏不住心意
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.62,0:23:09.08,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,兩人的溫度
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.08,0:23:13.78,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,歷經歲月 停留在此
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.78,0:23:15.78,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在平淡的日子裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.78,0:23:18.38,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,時常回想起我們第一次的吻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.38,0:23:33.93,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,孤獨的夜裡 在夢中與你相會
